'''Red Icebreaker''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that that was awarded to players who finished as Top 100 on the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]] '''Token-Collecting''' Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Red Icebreaker has the same appearance as [[Icebreaker]], but its dominant colors are replaced with a crimson red and black.

== Trivia ==
*In order to obtain this item, participants collected as many [[Snow Tokens]] in order to increase their score, which will determine their rank on the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Icebreaker]], [[Silver Icebreaker]], and [[Gold Icebreaker]].
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

